      "text": "  rule maxNumericGeneralVS(M:Val, vCons(V:Val, REST:ValSeq))\n    => maxNumericGeneralVS(\n         #if numericGt(numericView(V), numericView(M))\n         #then V\n         #else M\n         #fi,\n         REST\n       )"
