{"attributes": ["simplification"], "classification": "DOMAIN_LEMMA", "id_matches_hash": true, "independent_normalized_sha256": "23d7b940397fb8e3365532e4a44710e62c2afe797886ebd6bdd7d8fe6e2f503d", "index": 42, "module": "VERIFICATION", "normalized_sha256": "23d7b940397fb8e3365532e4a44710e62c2afe797886ebd6bdd7d8fe6e2f503d", "rationale": "Unproved dynamic string dispatch fact about the existing applyCmp symbol; no rule-free exact correspondence proof exists in Stage 1.", "source_rule_id": "rule-23d7b940397fb8e3365532e4a44710e62c2afe797886ebd6bdd7d8fe6e2f503d", "source_span": [136, 139], "text": "  rule applyCmp(\">\", V:Val, M:Val)\n    => strLt(codesOf(projectStrTotal(M)), codesOf(projectStrTotal(V)))\n    requires isStr(V) andBool isStr(M)\n    [simplification]"}
