{"attributes": [], "classification": "DEFINITION", "id_matches_hash": true, "independent_normalized_sha256": "12fc216d6de54491f7bd1862c52efa84459c7c3c6dd676a01ad5f28ca7105466", "index": 47, "module": "VERIFICATION", "normalized_sha256": "12fc216d6de54491f7bd1862c52efa84459c7c3c6dd676a01ad5f28ca7105466", "rationale": "Structural recurrence defining maxNumericGeneralVS by one comparison and tail recursion.", "source_rule_id": "rule-12fc216d6de54491f7bd1862c52efa84459c7c3c6dd676a01ad5f28ca7105466", "source_span": [157, 164], "text": "  rule maxNumericGeneralVS(M:Val, vCons(V:Val, REST:ValSeq))\n    => maxNumericGeneralVS(\n         #if numericGt(numericView(V), numericView(M))\n         #then V\n         #else M\n         #fi,\n         REST\n       )"}
